      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sinooda hang'weaka ashoohoodiga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea dea gasa gwatuudu ea dea oomu ea dea areara, ak geesin hang'weaka sinap muuchi, bea gadiyeeda heeda ghaydit, ak geesin hang'weaka ghaydidi bea Haruni, gawuurji gidarukusiinda NG'UTAMIIDA Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwasin weasta daghata bea dahaabu, bea oormeeda gasa gwatuudu ea dea oomu ea dea areara ea hang'da bumbuni miy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geegul dahaabu ea gamaning'iidi muuchi, ak geesin gea oormeeda gasa gwatuudu, ea gea oomng'i ea gea areeri, ea gea bumbuni miyaasiin nea gwasin gearnoocheanda huumwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geesin weasta gheata, ak geekula geat weeloojigaaschi assiyeenya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geesin ghealooda mananda sin gearnoocheanda ak geenapsa badayda weastida bea daghatean ak geerasa mananda nea ghealoodida gaba dahaabu, ea dea oormeeda gasa gwatuudu ea dea oomu ea dea areara, ea dea bumbuni miy gawuurji gidaghayi rukusiinda NG'UTAMIIDA Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geesin lagheanga oormeeda beari ak geayiin jeeda ghulghuloojiga dahaabu, ak geang'waarda gidasing'ooriida giirooraneeda aba gichea eang'oarda gheawunga orjooga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwayiin badaydeaba weastida bea daghatean ghoah lagheanga giipkeata orjooga Israeli, gawuurji gidarukusiinda NG'UTAMIIDA Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sinooda shageeda daghata",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasin shageeda daghata, sin gearnoocheanda nea gawuurji gidasisinda weasta daghata, bea dahaabu, ea oormeeda gasa gwatuudu ea dea oomu ea dea areara, ea dea bumbuni miy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gooyang'deay geawunda ea murdajeega shageedida bea daghatean geesin nea geegilip nibiyeenya, geawundaanyi ea murdajeagaaschi gabeachi gheata geatinda ak geegilip. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geanung' ghwaroap geat ghealooni ang'wan bea lagheanga ghealoanagi ea dughwaang' nea ghawaar booreega, ea gea areeri nih ghealooda madeeda gil, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ghealoodeaba iyeenya gwanda dea nyawiish, ea dea meajea oomu ea dea meeng'meeng'i, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ghealoodeaba samwagu nuut gameaji ea dughwaang', nuut ea ng'ooreadi, nuut ea oomu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ghealoodeaba samwagu, gwanda dea waar booshcheanda, ea dea bwaash, ea dea mur ak dahaabu geayiin jeesinga dabita nea geanung' gwajip geat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lagheanga ea damaniyeenya jea eeng'oorsa gheawunga orjooga Israeli, ak gawuurji giirooranga, ak gaba nih sing'oorsa gheawungaaschi bea eemooji atamaniyeenya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geesissa shageedida bea daghatean surumnyeanda uurji ghealooda bea dahaabooda miyaas, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak geesin haleanji iyeenya bea dahaabu sijip, ea gharin iyeenya bea dahaabu, ak geenapsa ghunoojisu asiyeenyean weeleedeaba shageedida bea daghatean, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak geayiin surumgiga asiyeenya bea dahaabuun jeeda ghunoojigiga asiyeenya bea weeleeda shageeda daghatean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ghuusigeaba surumsu asiyeenyean geayiin jeemba haleanji iyeenya ak geayiin mwadi bea hamarjeeda duukusa weasta daghatean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geesin gharin iyeenya bea dahaabu; ak geayiin ghuusigiga asiyeenya bea shageeda daghatean, bea weeleedeaba jih bea weastida bea daghatean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geesin gharin iyeenya bea dahaabu, ak geayiin madeeda heeda hing'eadayda weageaka asiyeenya bea daghata sirasa gheatean, neekeewa gifungajeagaaschi mida badayda ghealooda weasta daghata sisin muuchiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gearat eemajeek shageedida aba ghunoojigaaschi ea aba ghunoojiga weasta daghata ea aba ghealooda oormeeda gasa gwatuudu, ak goobiida badayda ghealooda weasta daghata ghayi sinap muuchi, ak ea maheeli shageeda daghata ea weasta daghata gawuurji gidarukusiinda NG'UTAMIIDA Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sinooda hang'weaka suuk bea Ashoohoocheanduumeeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwanap hang'da gul ng'eanyi ak ghwayiin sean oormeeda gasa gwatuudu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak seawadeeda mida bugusta hang'da gul ng'eanyiini gawuurji seawadeeda mida hang'da gharinga ak geeneaweesa weasta seawadeedida aba gideaba adaghabwaasha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak weeleeda hang'da gul ng'eanyi geenapsa duguuga uurji haghweega geeta siguura goomamanga, bea oormeeda gasa gwatuudu ea dea oomu, ea dea areara, ea dea siireat miy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geesin gureayeeka aba dahaabooda miyaas, ak geayiin gureayeeka bugusta duguugiga uurji haghweega geeta siguura goomamangean meadajeega sean bea goomamanga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gureayeeka ea goomamanga, gureayeeka ea goomamanga nea geeneaweesa weeleeda sean bea hang'da gul ng'eanyi bea gadiyeeda gawuurji gidarukusiinda NG'UTAMIIDA Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
