          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea ghealooda mananda miy siireada gulbeeda oormeeda gasa gwatuudu, ea dea oomu ea dea areara, sin gearnoocheanda gawuurji gidarukusiinda NG'UTAMIIDA Musa.",
          "type": "text",
