          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea heeda siyiina gheaboonyaneeda, bea dahaabooda miyaasiin ea gheaboonyangaaschi sea hoorgeeda gheaboonyanga ea haleanjeadaanyi sean, ea nagheeda jea eayeat; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "heeda wagiida bea dahaabu ea nagheeda giimearda ea geeta siing'andiita, ea hang'da beashooda bea gidaghuuta maheemajeanda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "heeda wagiida bea lagheanga oomng'i, ea gharinyeandaanyi oomu mideawa seawuutka, ea geedigaaschi, ea haleanjeadaanyi sean, ea harakta ea hoorgajeagaaschi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea hang'weaka sighasta bea seamooda ea daranajeagaaschi, ea hoorgajeagaaschi ea hang'da beashooda bea gidaghuuta seamooda, ea ghealoonigaaschi ea guhuunatkaaschi, ea haleanjeadaanyi sean bea gadiyeeda maheemajeanda, bea maheemajeanda siroondooscheesa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba huuydeanda hang'weaka sigadiyeata bea gadiyeeda heeda ghaydit, hang'weaka ghaydit bea Haruneeda was ashoohoocheanda, ea hang'weaka orjoagaaschi bea gadiyeeda ashoohoodiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba ng'asheega sean rukusa NG'UTAMIIDA Musa, hean gwasin fuga Israeli gadiyoojiga sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwadaah Musa gadiyoojiga sean, ng'ula, sisin gawuurji gidarukuteayda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak ea nihit, Ak ghoadaw Musa saawa ghawooda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.43",
